# The repo stays public, but the research log, strategy docs, and the paper
# are not published. These files still live in the working tree exactly where
# they always have; they are simply invisible to git. Edit them normally.
#
# Untracked on 2026-08-09 via `git rm --cached` (files were NOT deleted).
# Note: versions committed before that date remain in git history.
